Description: real-time data server for the TRIGA IPR-R1 reactor
 TrigaServer reads real-time values from the TRIGA IPR-R1 nuclear
 reactor (SystemAtom SPU via Modbus-RTU and the control-table PLC
 via OPC UA) and shares them on the network as CSV over TCP.
 .
 HTML documentation is installed in /usr/share/doc/trigaserver/html/
 and is served by trigaserver-doc.service on port 8080
 (http://localhost:8080/).
 .
 Both trigaserver.service and trigaserver-doc.service are enabled and
 started on install. Review /etc/trigaserver.conf if the data server
 cannot reach the site hardware.
